 "title": "ES2A to ES2J: 2 A fast recovery rectifiers, 50 V to 600 V, in SMA (DO-214AC)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "Seven single glass-passivated fast recovery rectifiers in the low-profile SMA (DO-214AC) surface-mount package, each carrying 2 A average forward current with a 50 A half-sine surge rating and reverse recovery of 35 ns at most. The grades differ in reverse voltage, from 50 V (ES2A) to 600 V (ES2J), and in forward drop and capacitance. Listed applications are high-frequency rectifying and freewheeling duty in switching power converters and inverters, across consumer, computer, automotive and telecom equipment. ES2J is the 600 V grade.",
